stateDiagram-v2
    state "Waiting for index" as Waiting
    state "Calculated" as Calculated
    state "Notified" as Notified
    state "Applied" as Applied
    state "Superseded" as Superseded
    [*] --> Waiting: enters notice period<br/>or retroactive entry
    Waiting --> Calculated: all window months published
    Calculated --> Notified: email + PDF letter sent
    Calculated --> Applied: date reached or retroactive
    Notified --> Applied: date reached
    Calculated --> Superseded: index revised by the source
    Applied --> Superseded: retroactive never communicated<br/>(base date correction)
    Superseded --> [*]
